# Products

## Vertirite (this product)
- The control plane for AI agents: every action authenticated, classified by
  risk, gated through policy, optionally held for human approval, and recorded
  in a cryptographically attributable audit trail
- The broker is the open-source (BSL 1.1) edge of the product line
- Governs the chokepoints an action must cross (egress / irreversible /
  credential) — deterministic, auditable, and running on the customer's own node

## Key Principles Across All Products
- Build correct, ironclad solutions — no band-aids
- Human-in-the-loop at decision and exception points
- Tenant isolation, audit trails, enterprise trust from day one

